{"__formatVersion":2,"__revision":"7df7371aae97f9c9","__entryId":"toast","entry":{"sceneUI":["<div class=\"toast-scene\">\n      <span class=\"toast-pill toast-fly\"><i></i>保存成功</span>\n      <div class=\"toast-scene-body\">\n        <input class=\"demo-input\" value=\"官网改版 v2\">\n        <div style=\"display:flex;justify-content:flex-end\"><button class=\"btn btn-primary\">保存</button></div>\n      </div>\n    </div>","<div class=\"toast-scene\">\n      <span class=\"toast-pill is-plain toast-fly\"><i></i>链接已复制到剪贴板</span>\n      <div class=\"toast-scene-body\">\n        <div style=\"display:flex;gap:8px\"><input class=\"demo-input\" style=\"flex:1;min-width:0\" value=\"https://vibe.guide/s/x8k2\"><button class=\"btn btn-outline\">复制链接</button></div>\n        <span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-3)\">任何获得链接的人都可以查看此文件</span>\n      </div>\n    </div>","<div class=\"toast-scene\">\n      <span class=\"toast-pill is-error toast-fly\"><i></i>网络异常，请稍后重试</span>\n      <div class=\"toast-scene-body\">\n        <i class=\"mk-line\" style=\"width:84%\"></i>\n        <i class=\"mk-line\" style=\"width:62%\"></i>\n        <i class=\"mk-line\" style=\"width:74%\"></i>\n      </div>\n    </div>","<div class=\"toast-scene\">\n      <span class=\"toast-pill toast-fly\"><i></i>已移动 3 个文件</span>\n      <div class=\"toast-scene-body\" style=\"gap:7px\">\n        <span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text)\">☑ 📄 首页改版.fig</span>\n        <span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text)\">☑ 📄 设计规范.md</span>\n        <span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-3)\">☐ 📄 发布清单.md</span>\n      </div>\n    </div>"],"sceneUI_en":["<div class=\"toast-scene\">\n      <span class=\"toast-pill toast-fly\"><i></i>Saved</span>\n      <div class=\"toast-scene-body\">\n        <input class=\"demo-input\" value=\"Website refresh v2\">\n        <div style=\"display:flex;justify-content:flex-end\"><button class=\"btn btn-primary\">Save</button></div>\n      </div>\n    </div>","<div class=\"toast-scene\">\n      <span class=\"toast-pill is-plain toast-fly\"><i></i>Link copied to clipboard</span>\n      <div class=\"toast-scene-body\">\n        <div style=\"display:flex;gap:8px\"><input class=\"demo-input\" style=\"flex:1;min-width:0\" value=\"https://vibe.guide/s/x8k2\"><button class=\"btn btn-outline\">Copy link</button></div>\n        <span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-3)\">This file can be viewed by anyone with the link</span>\n      </div>\n    </div>","<div class=\"toast-scene\">\n      <span class=\"toast-pill is-error toast-fly\"><i></i>Network error. Please try again later.</span>\n      <div class=\"toast-scene-body\">\n        <i class=\"mk-line\" style=\"width:84%\"></i>\n        <i class=\"mk-line\" style=\"width:62%\"></i>\n        <i class=\"mk-line\" style=\"width:74%\"></i>\n      </div>\n    </div>","<div class=\"toast-scene\">\n      <span class=\"toast-pill toast-fly\"><i></i>3 files moved</span>\n      <div class=\"toast-scene-body\" style=\"gap:7px\">\n        <span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text)\">☑ 📄 Home page revision.fig</span>\n        <span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text)\">☑ 📄 Design specifications.md</span>\n        <span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-3)\">☐ 📄 Release list.md</span>\n      </div>\n    </div>"],"anatomy":{"demo":"<div class=\"ap\" data-ap=\"root\"><span class=\"toast-pill\"><span class=\"ap\" data-ap=\"dot\"><i></i></span><span class=\"ap\" data-ap=\"text\"><span>保存成功</span></span></span></div>","demo_en":"<div class=\"ap\" data-ap=\"root\"><span class=\"toast-pill\"><span class=\"ap\" data-ap=\"dot\"><i></i></span><span class=\"ap\" data-ap=\"text\"><span>Saved</span></span></span></div>","parts":[{"key":"root","cn":"提示条本体","en":"Toast","desc":"浮在界面边缘的简短结果提示","desc_en":"A brief message that appears near the edge of the interface"},{"key":"dot","cn":"状态标识","en":"Icon","desc":"用图标或文字帮助辨认结果","desc_en":"Use icons or text to help identify results"},{"key":"text","cn":"文案","en":"Message","desc":"保持简短，直接说明操作结果","desc_en":"Keep it short and directly describe the results of the operation"}]},"variants":[{"cn":"成功","en":"Success","demo":"<span class=\"toast-pill\"><i></i>保存成功</span>","demo_en":"<span class=\"toast-pill\"><i></i>Saved</span>","when":"操作成功且不需要用户继续处理","when_en":"The operation is successful and does not require the user to continue processing."},{"cn":"失败","en":"Error","demo":"<span class=\"toast-pill is-error\"><i></i>网络异常，请重试</span>","demo_en":"<span class=\"toast-pill is-error\"><i></i>Network error. Please try again.</span>","when":"小问题失败，用户知道重试就好","when_en":"Use an error toast for a minor failure that only requires a retry."},{"cn":"普通","en":"Info","demo":"<span class=\"toast-pill is-plain\"><i></i>已复制到剪贴板</span>","demo_en":"<span class=\"toast-pill is-plain\"><i></i>Copied to clipboard</span>","when":"不带成功或失败倾向的状态确认","when_en":"Status confirmation without success or failure tendency"}],"use":[{"t":"<b>保存 / 提交成功</b>：用简短结果确认操作","m":"toast-success"},{"t":"<b>复制链接 / 验证码</b>：确认「已复制到剪贴板」","m":"toast-copy"},{"t":"<b>轻量失败提示</b>：网络抖动，重试就好","m":"toast-error"},{"t":"<b>不想打断当前操作</b>：用简短提示确认结果","m":"toast-timer"}],"dont":[{"t":"需要用户处理后才能继续的错误：使用 {c:modal}","m":"toast-modal"},{"t":"内容较多或带跳转入口：使用 {c:notification}","m":"toast-notif"},{"t":"连续弹出多条提示：后续内容会被遮挡，用户也难以及时阅读","m":"toast-stack","bad":true},{"t":"成功与失败使用相同样式：应配合明确文字和图标区分状态","m":"toast-same","bad":true}],"lessonPractice":{"title":"用户点击“复制邀请链接”，复制已经成功，也不需要继续处理。最合适的反馈是什么？","options":[{"id":"brief-result","label":"短暂显示“邀请链接已复制”，随后自动消失","feedback":"复制是已经完成的小操作，简短确认能说明结果，又不会打断用户接下来的工作。","correct":true},{"id":"persistent-alert","label":"在页面顶部保留“已复制”警告，直到用户关闭","feedback":"结果不需要长期记住或处理，持续占据页面会把一次轻量反馈误写成重要状态。","correct":false},{"id":"confirmation-modal","label":"打开确认弹窗，要求用户点击“知道了”才能继续","feedback":"复制已经完成且没有后续选择，弹窗增加了无意义的操作并打断当前流程。","correct":false}],"en":{"title":"Someone clicks Copy invite link. The copy succeeded and no further action is required. What feedback fits best?","options":[{"id":"brief-result","label":"Briefly show 'Invite link copied' and dismiss it automatically","feedback":"Copying is a completed lightweight action, so a brief confirmation reports the result without interrupting the next task.","correct":true},{"id":"persistent-alert","label":"Keep a 'Copied' alert at the top until the person closes it","feedback":"The result requires no later action or memory, so a persistent alert gives it unnecessary importance.","correct":false},{"id":"confirmation-modal","label":"Open a modal and require an OK click before continuing","feedback":"The action is already complete and needs no decision, so a modal adds an unnecessary interruption.","correct":false}]}},"lessonAgentPrompt":{"title":"你可以这样告诉 AI Agent","text":"点击“复制邀请链接”成功后，请短暂显示“已复制”，不要弹窗或长期占据页面。复制失败时显示明确失败原因和重试方式。请实际测试成功、失败，以及提示不会遮住当前操作。","en":{"title":"You can say this to an AI Agent","text":"After Copy invite link succeeds, briefly show 'Copied' without a modal or persistent banner. On failure, show a clear reason and retry path. Test both outcomes and confirm the toast does not cover the current task."}},"demoDetail":"<div class=\"dt-scene\"><div class=\"dt-toast\"><i></i>保存成功</div><div class=\"dm-skel\" style=\"padding-top:44px\"><i style=\"width:66%\"></i><i style=\"width:82%\"></i></div><div class=\"dt-body\"><span class=\"btn btn-outline\">保存</span></div></div><div class=\"demo-live-trigger\"><button class=\"btn btn-primary\" data-show-toast>触发交互示例</button><span class=\"hint\">上方为静态示意，点击按钮可查看交互效果</span></div>","references":[{"title":"Snackbar 轻量提示","source":"Material Design","url":"https://m3.material.io/components/snackbar/overview","title_en":"Snackbar"}],"scenes":["保存成功反馈","复制链接确认","网络异常轻提示","批量操作结果"],"en":{"demoDetail":"<div class=\"dt-scene\"><div class=\"dt-toast\"><i></i>Saved</div><div class=\"dm-skel\" style=\"padding-top:44px\"><i style=\"width:66%\"></i><i style=\"width:82%\"></i></div><div class=\"dt-body\"><span class=\"btn btn-outline\">Save</span></div></div><div class=\"demo-live-trigger\"><button class=\"btn btn-primary\" data-show-toast>Trigger interaction example</button><span class=\"hint\">The above is a static gesture, click the button to view the interaction effect</span></div>","use":[{"t":"Confirm save or copy","m":"toast-success"},{"t":"Acknowledge a small background action","m":"toast-copy"},{"t":"Show a brief success message","m":"toast-error"},{"t":"Give feedback without interrupting the current task","m":"toast-timer"}],"dont":[{"t":"Put a long explanation in a disappearing message","m":"toast-modal"},{"t":"Use it for an error that needs correction","m":"toast-notif"},{"t":"Stack so many toasts that they cover the page","m":"toast-stack","bad":true},{"t":"Make it disappear before it can be read","m":"toast-same","bad":true}],"scenes":["Saved","Copied","Added to favorites","Setting updated"],"sceneUI":["<div class=\"toast-scene\">\n      <span class=\"toast-pill toast-fly\"><i></i>Saved</span>\n      <div class=\"toast-scene-body\">\n        <input class=\"demo-input\" value=\"Website refresh v2\">\n        <div style=\"display:flex;justify-content:flex-end\"><button class=\"btn btn-primary\">Save</button></div>\n      </div>\n    </div>","<div class=\"toast-scene\">\n      <span class=\"toast-pill is-plain toast-fly\"><i></i>Link copied to clipboard</span>\n      <div class=\"toast-scene-body\">\n        <div style=\"display:flex;gap:8px\"><input class=\"demo-input\" style=\"flex:1;min-width:0\" value=\"https://vibe.guide/s/x8k2\"><button class=\"btn btn-outline\">Copy link</button></div>\n        <span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-3)\">This file can be viewed by anyone with the link</span>\n      </div>\n    </div>","<div class=\"toast-scene\">\n      <span class=\"toast-pill is-error toast-fly\"><i></i>Network error. Please try again later.</span>\n      <div class=\"toast-scene-body\">\n        <i class=\"mk-line\" style=\"width:84%\"></i>\n        <i class=\"mk-line\" style=\"width:62%\"></i>\n        <i class=\"mk-line\" style=\"width:74%\"></i>\n      </div>\n    </div>","<div class=\"toast-scene\">\n      <span class=\"toast-pill toast-fly\"><i></i>3 files moved</span>\n      <div class=\"toast-scene-body\" style=\"gap:7px\">\n        <span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text)\">☑ 📄 Home page revision.fig</span>\n        <span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text)\">☑ 📄 Design specifications.md</span>\n        <span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-3)\">☐ 📄 Release list.md</span>\n      </div>\n    </div>"],"variants":[{"demo":"<span class=\"toast-pill\"><i></i>Saved</span>","when":"The operation is successful and does not require the user to continue processing."},{"demo":"<span class=\"toast-pill is-error\"><i></i>Network error. Please try again.</span>","when":"Use an error toast for a minor failure that only requires a retry."},{"demo":"<span class=\"toast-pill is-plain\"><i></i>Copied to clipboard</span>","when":"Status confirmation without success or failure tendency"}]},"usageMocks":{"toast-success":"<div class=\"mk-scene \"><div class=\"mk-skel\"><i class=\"mk-line\" style=\"width:80%\"></i><i class=\"mk-line\" style=\"width:60%\"></i><i class=\"mk-line\" style=\"width:70%\"></i></div><span class=\"mk-toast-float\"><span class=\"mk-toast\"><i class=\"mk-dot \"></i>保存成功</span></span></div>","toast-copy":"<div class=\"mk-win\"><div class=\"mk-row between\"><span class=\"mk-link\" style=\"text-decoration:none\">https://vibe-ui.dev/x/8fk2</span><span style=\"flex:1\"></span><span class=\"mk-btn outline\">复制</span></div></div><div class=\"mk-row \"><span class=\"mk-toast\"><i class=\"mk-dot \"></i>复制成功</span></div>","toast-error":"<div class=\"mk-scene \"><div class=\"mk-skel\"><i class=\"mk-line\" style=\"width:80%\"></i><i class=\"mk-line\" style=\"width:60%\"></i><i class=\"mk-line\" style=\"width:70%\"></i></div><span class=\"mk-toast-float\"><span class=\"mk-toast\"><i class=\"mk-dot red\"></i>网络异常，请重试</span></span></div>","toast-timer":"<div class=\"mk-scene \"><div class=\"mk-skel\"><i class=\"mk-line\" style=\"width:80%\"></i><i class=\"mk-line\" style=\"width:60%\"></i><i class=\"mk-line\" style=\"width:70%\"></i></div><span class=\"mk-toast-float\"><span class=\"mk-toast\"><i class=\"mk-dot \"></i>已复制到剪贴板</span></span><div style=\"position:absolute;top:38px;left:50%;transform:translateX(-50%);width:96px\"><span class=\"mk-progress \" style=\"width:100%\"><i style=\"width:60%\"></i></span></div><div style=\"position:absolute;bottom:8px;width:100%;text-align:center;font-size:12px;color:var(--text-3)\">3 秒后自动消失</div></div>","toast-modal":"<div class=\"mk-scene \"><div class=\"mk-skel\"><i class=\"mk-line\" style=\"width:80%\"></i><i class=\"mk-line\" style=\"width:60%\"></i><i class=\"mk-line\" style=\"width:70%\"></i></div><div class=\"mk-mask\"></div><div class=\"mk-modal \"><span class=\"m-title\">支付失败</span><i class=\"mk-line\" style=\"width:85%\"></i>\n        <div class=\"m-actions\"><span class=\"mk-btn outline\">取消</span><span class=\"mk-btn primary\">重新支付</span></div></div></div>","toast-notif":"<div class=\"mk-scene \"><div class=\"mk-skel\"><i class=\"mk-line\" style=\"width:80%\"></i><i class=\"mk-line\" style=\"width:60%\"></i><i class=\"mk-line\" style=\"width:70%\"></i></div><div class=\"mk-notif\"><b>审核未通过</b><i class=\"mk-line\" style=\"width:95%\"></i><i class=\"mk-line\" style=\"width:70%\"></i>\n        <span class=\"mk-link\" style=\"font-size:12px\">查看原因 →</span></div></div>","toast-stack":"<div class=\"mk-scene \"><div class=\"mk-skel\"><i class=\"mk-line\" style=\"width:80%\"></i><i class=\"mk-line\" style=\"width:60%\"></i><i class=\"mk-line\" style=\"width:70%\"></i></div><span class=\"mk-toast-float\"><span class=\"mk-toast\"><i class=\"mk-dot \"></i>保存成功</span></span><span class=\"mk-toast-float\" style=\"top:32px\"><span class=\"mk-toast\"><i class=\"mk-dot \"></i>已同步</span></span><span class=\"mk-toast-float\" style=\"top:57px\"><span class=\"mk-toast\"><i class=\"mk-dot red\"></i>网络异常</span></span></div>","toast-same":"<div class=\"mk-scene \"><div class=\"mk-skel\"><i class=\"mk-line\" style=\"width:80%\"></i><i class=\"mk-line\" style=\"width:60%\"></i><i class=\"mk-line\" style=\"width:70%\"></i></div><span class=\"mk-toast-float\"><span class=\"mk-toast\"><i class=\"mk-dot \"></i>操作完成</span></span><div style=\"position:absolute;bottom:8px;width:100%;text-align:center;font-size:12px;color:var(--text-3)\">这是成功了还是失败了？</div></div>"}}}